# The bench's battle on Lava Highground's central plateau, which is level at
# height 150 from x 1504 to 2368 and z 1600 to 2560, so that no ballistic
# weapon fires down a cliff. Arm (player 0, the local player) holds the west
# half and Core (player 1, the computer player) the east half; the line
# between them is x 1980. Each side has an army of 150 mixed units and 20
# more every five seconds to tick 1500, patrolling into the other half and
# sent again every ten seconds with the factories' new units; a kbot lab, a
# vehicle plant and an aircraft plant, each with a long build queue; 16
# construction units building towers, fusion reactors and radars, left out
# of the patrols; 20 aircraft patrolling over the battle; and its economy in
# its own corner, far from the battle. About 550 units fight by tick 600.
